* Mutual TLS\n(mTLS)
** Principle
*** Extension of TLS
*** Both sides present\na certificate
*** Both sides validate
** Difference with TLS
*** TLS: server\nauthenticated only
*** mTLS: client also\nauthenticated
** Requirements
*** Client certificates
*** Certificate authority
*** Distribution & rotation
** Use cases
*** Service-to-service
*** Zero-trust networks
*** Kubernetes workloads
** Benefits & costs
*** Strong mutual identity
*** PKI management burden
